Telegram Claude Code Bridge is derived from RichardAtCT/claude-code-telegram,
originally authored by Richard Atkinson.

This fork is maintained by Fernando Taricano and includes substantial changes
for topic-scoped Telegram sessions, delivery durability, long-context handling,
operator visibility, and maintainer workflows.

The upstream project metadata declares MIT licensing in pyproject.toml and the
README. This repository includes the MIT license text explicitly so downstream
users can identify redistribution terms without relying on package metadata.

When redistributing substantial portions of this project, preserve this notice
and the LICENSE file.
